  "label": "Rats as carriers of disease and decay",
  "description": "Rats are widely associated in popular culture and historical narratives with disease, decay, and pestilence. This stereotype is rooted in real-world history, particularly the role of rats in spreading the Black Death. The meme leverages this stereotype to create a sense of dread and impending doom, using the visual of rats to symbolize a threat to human civilization. This association is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme's intent.",
